    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about feeling tired though. it's more like... when you look at it logically, everything is just random. if everything is random and nothing has inherent meaning, then there's no actual difference between existing and not existing. it's just two different states of being, right? one isn't better than the other. it's all just math in the end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
